[Section: 11. Important runtime defect]

In the final `environment.cpp`, the brace structure places:

```text
viewer->spinOnce()
```

outside the `while (!viewer->wasStopped())` loop.

This is important because normal PCL visualization loops need event processing while the loop runs.

The final structure can therefore impair viewer responsiveness/termination.

